  "chunk_title": "Create a Go environment",
  "chunk_content": "Create a Go environment  1. Create a new folder named *openai-go* for your project and a new Go code file named *sample.go*. Change into that directory:     ```cmd    mkdir openai-go    cd openai-go    ```  1. Install the following Go packages:     ```cmd    go get github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-go/sdk/ai/azopenai    ``` 1. Enable dependency tracking for your code.     ```cmd     go mod init example/azure-openai     ```",
